section.post-wrap
  .post_decor
    img.post_decor-img(src="@img/bg-figure-right.png")
  .container
    .post
      .post_article
        img.post_img(src="@img/posts/post1.jpg")
        p.post_data
          span  
            img.post_icon(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#person")  
            span.post_hum Admin
          span  
            img.post_icon(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#comment")
            span.post_comment No Comments
        h2.post_title To convert them into leads and customers
        p.post_text Uniquely Matrix Economically Sound Value Through Cooperative Technology. 
                  | Competently Parallel Task Fully Researched Data And Enterprise Process 
                  | Improvements. Collaboratively Expedite Quality Manufactured Products Via 
                  | Client-Focused Results Quickly Communicate Enabled Technology And Turnkey 
                  | Leadership Skills. Uniquely Enable Accurate Supply Chains Rather Than 
                  | Friction Technology.
        h3.post_title-sect The Digital Service For All
        p.post_text Appropriately Empower Dynamic Leadership Skills After Business Portals. 
                  | Globally My Carminate Interactive Supply Chains With Distinctive Quality 
                  | Vectors Global Sources Services. Uniquely Matrix Economically Sound Value 
                  | Through Cooperative Technology. Competently Parallel Task Fully Researched 
                  | Data And Enterprise Process Improvements.
        ul.post_list
          li.post_item Listen to what they say about you
          li.post_item Randomised words which.
          li.post_item Internet tend to repeat predefined chunks
        p.post_quote
          span.decor-el.decor-el_circle
            span.decor-el_comma.decor-el_comma--left
            span.decor-el_comma.decor-el_comma--right
          span “For the longest time, computers have been associated with work. Mainframes were for 
              | the Army, government agencies, and then large companies. 
              br
              | Workstations were for engineers and software programmers. PCs were initially for other 
              | white-collar jobs.”
        h3.post_title-sect Make real time a work improvements
        p.post_text Collaboratively Administrate Empowered Markets Via Plug-And-Play Networks. 
                  | Dynamically Procrastinate B2C Users After Installed Base Benefits. Dramatically 
                  | Visualize Customer Directed Convergence Without Revolutionary ROI.
        ol.post_list 
          li.post_item It brings the right people together with all the right information and tools to get work done
          li.post_item We provide operational efficiency, data security, and flexible scale
          li.post_item Your best work, together in one package that works seamlessly from your computer
          li.post_item Delivers the tools you need to save time Improve field performance always
        .share
          h3.share_title Share
          p.share_box
            a.share_link(href="https://www.facebook.com")
              img.share_img(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#fb")
            a.share_link(href="http://x.com")
              img.share_img(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#tv")
            a.share_link(href="https://www.linkedin.com")
              img.share_img(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#in")
            a.share_link(href="https://www.instagram.com")
              img.share_img(src="./images/icons/icons.svg#inst")
        form.form
          h3.form_title Leave a Comments
          .form_field.form_field--min
            label.form_label.label-base(for="formpostname") Full name *
            input.form_inp.inp-base(id="formpostname"
                                    type="text" 
                                    placeholder="Your Name")
          .form_field.form_field--min
            label.form_label.label-base(for="formpostemail") Your email *
            input.form_inp.inp-base(id="formpostemail"
                                    type="email" 
                                    placeholder="example@yourmail.com")
          .form_field
            label.form_label.label-base(for="formpostaddress") Website *
            input.form_inp.inp-base(id="formpostaddress"
                                    type="text"
                                    placeholder="your website address here")
          .form_field
            label.form_label.label-base(for="formpostmessage") Message *
            textarea.form_textarea.inp-base(id="formpostmessage" 
                                            placeholder="Hello there,I would like to talk about how to...")
          .form_field
            label.form_label.label-base.form_label--min(for="formpostcheckbox") 
              input.form_checkbox(id="formpostcheckbox" type="checkbox")
              span#savedata Save my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment.
          button.form_submit.btn-base() Post Comment
      aside.post_aside
        include ../block/new-posts-block
        include ../block/categories-block